OL,3,GNEWSAMother backs calls to stop
OL,4,Akillers' early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 families have called on
OL,7,Fthe government to stop killers
OL,8,Fconvicted of any form of manslaughter
OL,9,Fbeing released early to ease prison
OL,10,Fovercrowding in England and Wales.
OL,12,FIn a letter to Justice Secretary Alex
OL,13,FNorris, the families said they felt
OL,14,Fvictims were "being asked to bear the
OL,15,Fconsequences of the prison capacity
OL,16,Fcrisis".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
