OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMother backs calls to stop
OL,4,Akillers' early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FSignatories include Emma Webber, whose
OL,7,Fson Barnaby was stabbed to death in the
OL,8,FNottingham attacks in 2023, and whose
OL,9,Fkiller Valdo Calocane was convicted of
OL,10,Fmanslaughter on the basis of diminished
OL,11,Fresponsibility.
OL,13,FSpeaking on Radio 4's Today programme,
OL,14,FBridget Phillipson, Minister for Women
OL,15,Fand Equalities, defended the early
OL,16,Frelease scheme.
